# Local GTFS data files — too large for git, developer-supplied only.
# Ignore everything in public/gtfs/ (e.g. local dev nyct-subway.zip)…
public/gtfs/*
# …but keep the committed game-day feeds.
!public/gtfs/amtrak.zip
!public/gtfs/hartford-line.zip
!public/gtfs/njt-rail.zip
!public/gtfs/septa-rail.zip

